Export `parseQuery(raw)` turning `'done=true&page=2'` into `{ done: 'true', page: '2' }`:
- an empty string returns `{}`;
- split on `&`, then each pair on the FIRST `=` (a pair without `=` gets value `''`);
- decode keys and values with `decodeURIComponent`.
All values stay strings.

